---
permalink: /en/galeria/
title: "Gallery & videos"
description: "Real photos and videos of the Palomino Islands voyage: sea lions, the yacht and the route. Includes reports by CNN and El Tour de los Incas."
---
{% set t = i18n[lang] %}
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="section section--sky">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>›</span> Gallery</nav>
    <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">Gallery</p>
    <h1>The experience, in real images</h1>
    <p class="lead">We only use authentic photos and videos from our voyages. Click any photo to enlarge it.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Photos</p>
    <h2>Moments from the voyage</h2>
    <div class="gallery-grid" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">
      {% for n in range(1, 36) %}
      <img class="zoomable" src="/assets/img/galeria/g{{ n }}.jpg" alt="Guests swimming with sea lions at the Palomino Islands" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:var(--radius);display:block">
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--sky">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Marine wildlife</p>
    <h2>The wildlife of the Palomino Islands</h2>
    <p class="lead">Seabirds, sea lions and other species of Peru's cold sea that you'll see on the voyage. <strong>Tap a card</strong> to see its behavior, diet, habitat and breeding.</p>
    <div class="fauna-grid stagger" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      {% for s in fauna %}
      <button type="button" class="fauna-card reveal" style="--i:{{ loop.index0 % 12 }}" data-fauna="{{ s.slug }}" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="{{ s.name_en }} — view details">
        <span class="fauna-card__media">
          <img src="{{ s.photo }}" alt="{{ s.name_en }} ({{ s.sci }})" loading="lazy">
          <span class="fauna-card__ph">{{ icon("camera","ico ico--lg") }}<small>Photo coming soon</small></span>
          <span class="fauna-card__n">{{ s.n }}</span>
          <span class="fauna-card__type">{{ s.type_en }}</span>
        </span>
        <span class="fauna-card__body">
          <span class="fauna-card__name">{{ s.name_en }}</span>
          <span class="fauna-card__sci">{{ s.sci }}</span>
          <span class="fauna-card__more">View details {{ icon("info") }}</span>
        </span>
      </button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {# Hidden detail content — cloned into the modal when a card is tapped #}
    <div hidden>
      {% for s in fauna %}
      <div class="fauna-detail" data-detail="{{ s.slug }}">
        <div class="fdetail__head">
          <div class="fdetail__photo"><img src="{{ s.photo }}" alt="{{ s.name_en }}" onerror="this.style.display='none'"></div>
          <div class="fdetail__intro">
            <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px">{{ s.type_en }}</p>
            <h3>{{ s.name_en }}</h3>
            <p class="fdetail__sci">{{ s.name_es }} · <em>{{ s.sci }}</em></p>
            <span class="fdetail__life">{{ icon("clock") }} Lives ~{{ s.lifespan }} yrs</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="fdetail__grid">
          <div><h4>{{ icon("info") }} Behavior</h4><p>{{ s.behavior_en }}</p></div>
          <div><h4>{{ icon("fish") }} Diet</h4><ul>{% for f in s.food_en %}<li>{{ f }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div>
          <div><h4>{{ icon("anchor") }} Habitat</h4><p>{{ s.habitat_en }}</p></div>
          <div><h4>{{ icon("award") }} Breeding</h4><p>{{ s.repro_en }}</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="fmodal" data-fmodal aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="fmodal__panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Wildlife fact sheet" data-fmodal-panel>
        <button type="button" class="fmodal__close" data-fmodal-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">In the media</p>
    <h2>Reports about Ecocruceros</h2>

    <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:var(--space-6);align-items:start">
      <div>
        <div class="embed">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/{{ site.video.incas }}" title="Report — El Tour de los Incas" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="embed-caption">Report by the YouTube channel <strong>{{ site.video.incasChannel }}</strong>.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="embed">
          <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/{{ site.video.cnn }}" title="CNN report (2006)" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="embed-caption">Our work, featured in a <strong>CNN</strong> report (2006).</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      <p>See more on our YouTube channel: <a href="{{ site.social.youtube }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">@ecocruceros8644</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
